+# Configure.ac script for Libgcrypt
+# Copyright (C) 1998, 1999, 2000, 2001, 2002, 2003, 2004, 2006,
+#               2007, 2008, 2009, 2011 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+# Copyright (C) 2012-2024  g10 Code GmbH
